MODULE selftest

FUNCTION run built-in test
    create an isolated temporary directory
    strictly parse a complete documented configuration
    validate a representative package manifest
    prove parent traversal is rejected
    construct a small in-memory ZIP, save it temporarily, extract it safely,
        and require its declared executable
    report each passing area and use no network or project state
    remove only the exact known temporary file and directories created by the
        test, reporting any cleanup failure
